.TH demangle_free 3 "February 2026" "Substrate" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
demangle_free \- free memory returned by demangle
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <demangle.h>
.PP
.BI "void demangle_free(char *" str ");"
.fi
.SH LIBRARY
libdemangle (\fI-l:libdemangle.a\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B demangle_free()
releases memory returned by
.BR demangle (3).
.PP
Passing
.B NULL
is safe.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR demangle (3),
.BR free (3)
